Negative control for the withdrawal request's gate (R-PAGES, Commissions tab).

Request withdrawal is drawn only while the module's own `canWithdraw` flag is
true — the brand setting is on AND the account holds a payable balance. This
mutant deletes the gate from the DECLARATION: the control is offered to every
client, including one with nothing to withdraw, and a request the module would
refuse is one click away. The runtime still hides gated controls correctly; the
declaration just stops asking it to.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Expected red (module lane): record-archetype-routing.spec.ts once it covers the
affiliate withdrawal record — the `requestWithdrawal` action must carry
`gate: "canWithdraw"`.

